{"id":"fbc74eb888873878","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-context.md","title":"df-context","display":"df-context","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-terms]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-replace]]"],"label":"56-df-context","aliases":["56-df-context"],"display":"df-context","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-context"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-context</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-context\"><code>df-context</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V\">\\(\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为新符号；位置、子项与替换分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\square\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal F\\cup\\{\\square\\},\\operatorname{ar}\\cup\\{(\\square,0)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_\\square\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal F\\cup\\{\\square\\},\\operatorname{ar}\\cup\\{(\\square,0)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_\\square,\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_\\square,\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(C)\\mid C|_p=\\square\\}\n\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(C)\\mid C|_p=\\square\\}\n\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Hole}(C)|=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Hole}(C)|=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\,\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\,\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(C[t]\\coloneqq C[t]_p\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\,\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\,\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(C[t]\\coloneqq C[t]_p\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书上下文允许零个、一个或多个洞；Ctx* 保存此一般概念，Ctx 专指一洞上下文。洞是新增零元函数符号，不是新增变量，故不会被替换当作普通变量替走。Hole(C) 为单点集确保填洞定义无歧义。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§2.1.1，印刷第26–27页，OCR页块47–48。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-context","text":"`df-context`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal V$ 与 $T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 如 [[56-df-terms]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 为新符号；位置、子项与替换分别见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]、[[56-df-replace]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 为新符号；位置、子项与替换分别见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]、[[56-df-replace]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V$ 为新符号；位置、子项与替换分别见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-subterm]]、[[56-df-replace]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\square\\notin\\mathcal F\\cup\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\square\\coloneqq\n(\\mathcal F\\cup\\{\\square\\},\\operatorname{ar}\\cup\\{(\\square,0)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_\\square,\\mathcal V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(C)\\mid C|_p=\\square\\}\n\\qquad(C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\coloneqq\n\\{C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}^{*}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\mid|\\operatorname{Hole}(C)|=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\,\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Hole}(C)\\,\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(C[t]\\coloneqq C[t]_p\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1659,"backlinks":[{"id":"ebb018d2e72663e2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，一洞上下文集合 $\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-context]]。"},{"id":"59b9207cce58252c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$E\\subseteq T^2$；$(s,t)\\in E$ 表示等式 $s=t$，无改写规则的左端/变量限制。$\\mathrm{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)$ 和替换应用见 [[56-df-context]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]。"},{"id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-proofterm]]、[[56-df-labelled-reduction]] 的接口。具体步嵌入 $e_R$ 的局部参数为 $a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$、$u=(p,l,r)$、$\\lambda=(l,r)$，并取 $\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$ 满足 $s|_p=l\\sigma$；匹配接口见 [[56-df-redex-occurrence]]。$\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)$ 见 [[56-df-context]]；$\\widehat C$ 在唯一孔处保留参数，其余变量及函数用证明项的恒等构造。路径构造独立以 $\\rho\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 为局部参数；上下文嵌入独立以 $\\phi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$、$C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,V)$ 为局部参数。"},{"id":"ea6d0d000271b1cf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$V$ 为变量集，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$>\\subseteq T^2$；替换、单孔上下文及下降方向良基性分别见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-context]]、[[56-df-well-founded]]。$R\\subseteq T^2$ 为规则集合；另取任意集合 $A$ 与 $Q\\subseteq A^2$，用于通用严格序缩写。本定义把序本身的性质与它对规则的定向分开。"},{"id":"b2a80488e51ffa03","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$Q\\subseteq T^2$。$\\mathrm{StrictOrder}$、$\\mathrm{SubtermProp}$、替换和单孔上下文分别见 [[56-df-reduction-order]]、[[56-df-subterm-property]]、[[56-df-substitution-application]]、[[56-df-context]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-context.md]]"},{"id":"45a37df986b19f47","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定签名 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、与 $F$ 不交的可数无限变量集 $V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$ 及普通项重写系统 $R$。替换集 $S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$ 及其在项上的延拓采用 [[56-df-substitution-application]]；一洞上下文及填洞采用 [[56-df-context]]；$\\to_R$ 采用 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]。本节点所有参数按各公式中的量词独立取值。"}],"outgoing":["5e02461ce48023cc","da02033e6d596cae","c3157a722a0edf96","b58d01262349aaf3"]}